{"id":"652924395","kind":"article","title":"欢迎来到 Refold 语言习得路线图","author":"Refold","original_authors":["Refold"],"original_source_urls":["https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/overview"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"外语习得","date":"2023-08-29","updated":"2023-12-12","votes":129,"comment_count":14,"minutes":1,"chars":466,"keywords":["Refold","二语习得","沉浸式学习","主动沉浸","被动收听"],"summary":"Refold 欢迎页说明沉浸式学习与传统方法不同，并将路线图概括为方法、学习心态和核心活动三部分，介绍主动沉浸、被动收听与主动非沉浸练习。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/652924395","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"开始学"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"方法"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"心态"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"核心活动"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"进阶"}],"html":"<blockquote data-pid=\"7dsBjocR\">返回目录：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"671671625\" href=\"#/post/671671625\">从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）</a></blockquote><h2 id=\"sec-1\">开始学</h2><p data-pid=\"cGQ64xKD\">沉浸学习与传统方法大不相同。在你踏上语言学习之旅之前，你得做好准备。本节将介绍整个旅程中你将使用的方法、心态和工具。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">方法</h2><ol><li data-pid=\"jPg7NTg8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/a/language-acquisition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0A1 语言习得</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"fcuoQJCM\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/a/roadmap-overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0A2 路线总览</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup><br/> </li></ol><h2 id=\"sec-3\">心态</h2><p data-pid=\"Yt6AF8ly\">在这个过程中，正确的心态是很重要的。下面的文章将帮助你解除破旧的语言学习方法，进入沉浸学习心态。</p><ol><li data-pid=\"Isv3hefU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/b/enjoyment\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0B1 享受语言</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"AS1nhLt3\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/b/tolerate-ambiguity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0B2 容忍模糊感</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li></ol><h2 id=\"sec-4\">核心活动</h2><p data-pid=\"GPELsGnb\">在你迈向流利的旅程中，有三种核心活动必不可少：主动沉浸，被动收听，以及主动非沉浸学习。我们对这些核心活动分别进行了概述。</p><ol><li data-pid=\"TWqtWmqT\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/c/active-immersion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0C1 主动沉浸</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"sJdOUeRI\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/c/passive-listening\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0C2 被动收听</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"q1KuLNiU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/c/active-study\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0C3 主动非沉浸学习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup><br/> </li></ol><h2 id=\"sec-5\">进阶</h2><p data-pid=\"SBf-Rlod\">阶段 0 的目标是概述 Refold 方法。一旦你读完了这些文章，就可以进入阶段 1 了。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><hr/><p data-pid=\"1tS-_5XH\">下一篇：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"653395751\" href=\"#/post/653395751\">0A1：语言习得 </a></p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"ry7H9Vji\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">LockXie</span>，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-0/overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Welcome to the Refold Roadmap | Refold</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 0A1：语言习得 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"653395751\" href=\"#/post/653395751\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\